0006+  2108             ;**************************************************************
0007+  2108             ;* If reactor status is + (safe) then color pulses just       
0008+  2108             ;* yellow. If reactor status is - (ready to blow) then color  
0009+  2108             ;* is red/yellow pulses.                                      
0010+  2108             ;*                                                            
0011+  2108             ;* Uses: temp1          
0012+  2108             ;*
0013+  2108             ;* objst+zreactor status notes:
0014+  2108             ;*
0015+  2108             ;* Bit 80: Minus if touched and counting + if safe
0016+  2108             ;*     40: On Screen Bit
0017+  2108             ;*     20: Used with 80 above to signify touched and ready to blow up
0018+  2108             ;*                                 
0019+  2108             ;**************************************************************
0020+  2108 A5 9F       react   lda frame           ;Continue to move intensity
