1073+  2800             		.sbttl "Stalactites in the Maze"
1074+  2800             		;********************************************
1075+  2800             		;* They hang above trip pads and force rex
1076+  2800             		;* to run over the pad. If hit, they vibrate
1077+  2800             		;********************************************
1078+  2800             		;* Tites objst notes:
1079+  2800             		;*
