3155+  3539                 .sbttl "Move Thing"
3156+  3539             ;************************************************
3157+  3539             ;* Will add an objects velocity to its position 
3158+  3539             ;* and then set collision case flags.           
3159+  3539             ;*                                              
3160+  3539             ;* Inputs: X = object index                     
3161+  3539             ;*         velx(x),vely(x),objx(x),objy(x)      
3162+  3539             ;*                                              
3163+  3539             ;* Output: Update position, collision flags set 
3164+  3539             ;*                                              
3165+  3539             ;* Uses:   A,X,Y,temp4, 5 bytes stack           
3166+  3539             ;************************************************   
